      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.23 (vs ₹0.68 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.23 (down from ₹0.68 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹56.9m (up 41% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹5.62m (down 52% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 9.9% (down from 29% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 98% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 45% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
